[{"id":"CN-TR-014","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["TCP","MSS","MTU","抓包"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP","articlePath":"posts/ec8f5dd0/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP","articlePath":"posts/ec8f5dd0/"}],"articleIndex":14,"articleCount":19,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>MSS、MTU 和 PMTUD 分别处于什么边界？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>MTU 是链路可承载的 IP 包大小，MSS 是 TCP 数据部分上限，PMTUD 是发现路径可用包大小的机制。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>隧道、IPv6 和 ICMP 过滤都可能造成路径 MTU 黑洞。排查时同时看握手 MSS、IP 包大小和 ICMP Packet Too Big/需要分片反馈。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"playwright-context-isolation","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"Playwright","tags":["BrowserContext","测试隔离"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(七)浏览器上下文.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(七)浏览器上下文","articlePath":"posts/8dafa0dc/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(七)浏览器上下文.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(七)浏览器上下文","articlePath":"posts/8dafa0dc/"},{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(十二)项目实战.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(十二)项目实战","articlePath":"posts/8141684d/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>BrowserContext 隔离是否等于测试数据隔离？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>不等于，它只负责浏览器端会话隔离。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>数据库记录、缓存、消息队列和第三方沙箱仍可能共享。测试必须使用唯一数据标识，并由创建数据的 Fixture 负责清理。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"playwright-install-layers","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"Playwright","tags":["安装","环境"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(二)快速开始.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(二)快速开始","articlePath":"posts/da4e7889/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(二)快速开始.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(二)快速开始","articlePath":"posts/da4e7889/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>为什么安装 \u003ccode>pytest-playwright\u003c/code> 后还要运行 \u003ccode>playwright install\u003c/code>？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>前者安装 Python 包，后者下载匹配的浏览器二进制。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>Playwright 客户端、浏览器二进制和 Linux 系统依赖是三层资源。只完成其中一层，测试仍可能在启动浏览器时失败。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"playwright-drag-choice","type":"choice","priority":2,"deck":"Playwright","tags":["拖拽","鼠标"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(五)页面交互操作.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(五)页面交互操作","articlePath":"posts/fdf6b990/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(五)页面交互操作.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(五)页面交互操作","articlePath":"posts/fdf6b990/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>标准拖拽组件首先应尝试哪种方式？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>A\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>高层 \u003ccode>drag_to()\u003c/code> 更接近用户行为并保留 Playwright 的定位与可操作性检查；仅在组件需要特殊指针轨迹时降级到底层鼠标操作。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":["A"],"options":[{"key":"A","labelHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>source.drag_to(target)\u003c/code>\u003c/p>\n"},{"key":"B","labelHtml":"\u003cp>固定屏幕绝对坐标\u003c/p>\n"},{"key":"C","labelHtml":"\u003cp>直接修改目标 DOM\u003c/p>\n"}]},{"id":"playwright-wait-boundary","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"Playwright","tags":["自动等待","断言"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(四)断言与等待.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(四)断言与等待","articlePath":"posts/70bae600/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(四)断言与等待.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(四)断言与等待","articlePath":"posts/70bae600/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>为什么 \u003ccode>click()\u003c/code> 成功后仍然需要断言？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>自动等待只保证动作可执行，不保证业务结果正确。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>点击会等待元素可操作并发送输入事件；成功提示、URL、订单状态或后端数据属于动作后的业务结果，需要单独使用 Web-first 断言或 API 核验。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]}]